SUMMARY:Sunday Sounds: Harp ft. Lo Wolf
DESCRIPTION:Free for Members or included with Museum admission \nThe Museum promotes wellness by creating opportunities for connection\, creativity\, and reflection through art. We believe these experiences support emotional well-being\, reduce stress\, and strengthen our community. \nFeaturing: Lo Wolf \nCaptivated at an early age by this incredible instrument\, Lo has a unique and improvisational style honed by years of study in the classical and Celtic modes. She brings her singer-songwriter sensibilities to bear and draws on the world around her to create soothing and memorable soundscapes that reflect the beauty she sees. Performances will take place July 5\, 19\, and August 2
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/sunday-sounds-lo-wolf/
LOCATION:Asheville Art Museum\, 2 South Pack Square\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
GEO:35.5946714;-82.5512827
