SUMMARY:High August Swashbuckle w/ The Pubsters
DESCRIPTION:Ahoy\, Ye Hearties!The Second Annual High August Swashbuckle makes landfall on Sunday August 2nd and ye be summoned! Join the crew in merriment\, grog sloshing\, and dancing The Hornpipe with live music from The Pubsters. Our mateys at Muddy River Distilling will be here pouring samples of their finest rums for all our old salts and carousers. And true to form\, too\, we’ll have delightful captain-worthy refreshments for the young lads and lassies setting sail on our voyage. Scribe ye own message in a bottle\, bring color to ye favorite map\, send all the rapscallion pirates to walk the plank at the Walk The Plank Dunk Tank! Dust off yer tricorn hats\, strap on yer boots and show us yer best pirate swagger for a chance to win the costume contest!\nMore treasures await! Ye needn’t any coin to attend so mark ye Ship’s Log and grab your mates – The High August Swashbuckle is here.\n  \n\n\n‘The Mule’ – Tasting Room \n\n\n\n\n\nSay hello to The Mule – a full-service bar/event space in the home of Devil’s Foot Beverage’s production facility. Draft soda\, beer\, & wine – as well as delicious cocktails & mocktails featuring Devil’s Foot craft sodas and the largest collection of NC-made spirits in Asheville – all at your fingertips just outside of Biltmore Village! Open now for all of your beverage & party needs! devilsfootbrew.com/the-mule
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/high-august-swashbuckle-w-the-pubsters-2/
LOCATION:The Mule at Devils Foot Beverages\, 131 Sweeten Creek Road\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/747790241_122295820694019470_4315465060069119278_n-e1785162590279.jpg
GEO:35.5588369;-82.5218977
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Mule at Devils Foot Beverages 131 Sweeten Creek Road Asheville NC 28803 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=131 Sweeten Creek Road:geo:-82.5218977,35.5588369
END:VEVENT
